  I will add them to this list.  If you are interested in getting your
  translations archived on sunsite.unc.edu, please read the directory
  structure specification at
  http://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/docs/HOWTO/translations/Directory-
  Structure and get in touch with me.

